---

This project bundles no third-party code, but depends on:

  Kokoro (Apache-2.0)      https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro
  PySide6 (LGPL-3.0)       https://www.qt.io/qt-for-python
  PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause)   https://pytorch.org
  FFmpeg (LGPL/GPL)        https://ffmpeg.org  — a separate system install

The Kokoro-82M voice model is downloaded at runtime from Hugging Face under its
own licence.
